Task type: composition in javascript.
Task prompt: A deep inheritance tree is causing brittle behavior. Refactor the Robot class to use composition, injecting an Engine and a Frame instead of inheriting from them.

Current code:
class Engine { speed() { return 10; } }
class Frame { weight() { return 50; } }

class Robot {
  constructor(engine, frame) {
    this.engine = engine;
    this.frame = frame;
  }

  forward() {
    return this.engine.speed();
  }
}


